00:45:59.070 --> 00:46:17.939
Derek Chiang: So, this new EIP, EIP7819, is essentially, like, this very elegant idea that we can, essentially make proxies a native concept on Ethereum by reusing the delegate concept introduced in, EIP 7702.

305
00:46:17.940 --> 00:46:29.149
Derek Chiang: So, if you guys recall, with 7702, you know, you can, send a new transaction type, you know, that, essentially, sets the codes of an account to.

