00:46:39.830 --> 00:46:57.030
Derek Chiang: you know, of the accounts only takes 23 bytes, so 3 bytes for the prefix, and 20 bytes for the address of the implementation. So this is, like, kind of like the minimal possible, I guess, proxy, right? You know, but the reason why Samsung 2 is not, like, enough by itself is because

