01:04:41.710 --> 01:04:48.240
Ansgar Dietrichs: Okay, then, next up is Jocham with EIP7668.

424
01:04:49.000 --> 01:04:53.789
jochem-brouwer: Yeah, I can be very short, so EIP7668 is about to be moved.

425
01:04:54.010 --> 01:04:56.690
jochem-brouwer: bloom field is, and I think I just folded them.

