Kevaundray Wedderburn: precompiles that sort of have static costs. Like, if Blake2F was always just, like, 1,000 guests?

465
01:09:54.510 --> 01:10:03.060
Kevaundray Wedderburn: But if the cost is, sort of dynamic or based on branching, then I think it becomes a lot more difficult. Like, you need a lookup table, essentially.

